{"id": "DXanI5ECvq-", "title": "Video by denzelwilliamsonjames", "description": "631 Howatt Drive is the perfect blend of character + luxury in Jagare Ridge.\n\nThis is one of those homes that feels warm the second you walk in—yet still has that elevated, high-end finish and presence you expect at this level. And being just under $1.5M, it sits in a sweet spot for buyers who want something special without the cookie-cutter feel.\n\nQuick question: what matters more to you in a luxury home?\nA) timeless character\nB) modern luxury finishes\nC) location + lifestyle\nComment A/B/C and I’ll tell you what stands out most about this one.\n\nListing Agent: @nathandrennan_rimrock \n\nDM me “HOWATT” if you want the full details.\n\n#JagareRidge #EdmontonRealEstate #YEGRealtor #LuxuryHomes #HomeTour", "channel": "denzelwilliamsonjames", "uploader_id": "836850292", "uploader": "Denzel Williamson-James | Edmonton Realtor®", "timestamp": 1776822101, "like_count": 523, "comment_count": 32, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/145.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1642508043645221a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 77.957, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNiZLTmbvk5lm3WaRR7tyOiNb_l6mHWeQVGF6hodwEFSURPWhJIw4i1uh6mlgoaJywvNn6ihLS-8Iv1RXHO0KE6GWYkHmYDL1F8LTw.mp4?_nc_cat=106&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=ckTPp1NIzGUQ7kNvwEBPoLV&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=HtjuNd5Sszl6bRiZolWG3g&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQO5RanODkMW89TxNYB0tXWkNgN7PcrHGLwEQbG2jjeCcQ&oe=6ADEF3C3", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext